511
00:40:33,499 --> 00:40:34,841
<i>Ahora es mi deber...</i>

512
00:40:35,019 --> 00:40:37,078
<i>...ahora es mi responsabilidad...</i>

513
00:40:37,299 --> 00:40:38,516
